</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, Your life is divine, eternal.</l><l>Lord, Your life regenerated me.</l><l>Lord, Your life is growing within me,</l><l>Until I am fully conformed to Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lord, Your love is wide as the ocean.</l><l>Lord, Your love is deep as the sea.</l><l>Lord, Your love encompasses the nations,</l><l>And that is all I want to live in me.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Lord, Your light is shining within us;</l><l>Lord, Your light drives darkness away.</l><l>Lord, Your light is guiding us onwards,</l><l>Preparing us for the coming wedding day.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
